msgid "# Kimi-K3 (Experimental)"
msgstr "# Kimi-K3（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"!!! warning \"Experimental support\"\n"
"    Kimi K3 support in vLLM-Ascend 0.26.0rc is an initial experimental release. It is intended for evaluation and validation with the fixed deployment configurations in this guide. Supported scenarios, performance, and configuration interfaces may evolve in later releases; do not treat this guide as a production support commitment."
msgstr ""
"!!! warning \"实验性支持\"\n"
"    vLLM-Ascend 0.26.0rc 中的 Kimi K3 支持是初步的实验性版本，旨在配合本指南中的固定部署配置进行评估和验证。支持场景、性能和配置接口可能会在后续版本中演进；请勿将本指南视为生产支持承诺。"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3 is a native multimodal Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model. Its language "
"backbone combines Kimi Delta Attention (KDA) with periodic Gated Multi-head "
"Latent Attention (MLA), and uses Stable LatentMoE for expert computation. "
"The model also integrates a MoonViT vision encoder and supports text, image "
"understanding, reasoning, and tool calling."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K3 是一款原生多模态混合专家（MoE）模型。其语言主干结合了 Kimi Delta "
"Attention（KDA）与周期性门控多头潜在注意力（MLA），并使用 Stable LatentMoE 进行专家计算。该模型还集成了 MoonViT"
" 视觉编码器，支持文本、图像理解、推理和工具调用。"

msgid ""
"This document is validated and written based on **vLLM-Ascend 0.26.0rc**."
msgstr "本文档基于 **vLLM-Ascend 0.26.0rc** 进行验证和编写。"

msgid ""
"The current release includes a subset of the Kimi K3 optimization features "
"that have been validated for this version. To provide a reproducible and "
"supportable baseline, this guide uses fixed deployment configurations "
"instead of exposing every tunable optimization."
msgstr ""
"当前版本包含已针对此版本验证的 Kimi K3 优化功能子集。为提供可复现且可支持的基线，本指南使用固定的部署配置，而非暴露所有可调优化项。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持特性"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported "
"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)获取该模型的支持特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [feature guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)获取特性的配置。"

