msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid ""
"!!! warning \"DSpark long-context limitation\"\n"
"    For the current `Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark` draft weights, DSpark acceptance is low for approximately 20K–40K-token inputs and remains low for longer contexts. Consequently, 128K inputs may receive no effective speculative-decoding benefit. This is a limitation of the current draft weights, not of the DSpark framework; validate acceptance and end-to-end performance for the target workload before enabling the draft model."
msgstr ""
"!!! warning \"DSpark 长上下文限制\"\n"
"    对于当前的 `Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark` 草稿权重，DSpark 在约 20K–40K token 输入下的接受率较低，且在更长上下文中仍然较低。因此，128K 输入可能无法获得有效的投机解码收益。这是当前草稿权重的限制，而非 DSpark 框架的限制；在启用草稿模型之前，请针对目标工作负载验证接受率和端到端性能。"

msgid ""
"The A2 capabilities have not changed in this release and remain consistent "
"with **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0**; no iterative updates have been made."
msgstr "A2 的能力在本版本中未发生变化，与 **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0** 保持一致；未进行迭代更新。"

msgid "### 5.1 Mixed Prefill/Decode Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 混合 Prefill/Decode 部署"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A3 (four-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A3（四节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses four Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes. vLLM"
" data parallelism spans the four nodes, each node runs one DP rank, and "
"tensor parallelism uses all 16 NPUs in the node. The resulting topology is "
"DP4/TP16/EP64."
msgstr ""
"经过验证的混合部署使用四个Atlas 800 A3（64G × 16）节点。vLLM数据并行跨越四个节点，每个节点运行一个DP "
"rank，张量并行使用节点内的全部16个NPU。最终拓扑为DP4/TP16/EP64。"

msgid ""
"On Atlas 800 A3, a mixed Prefill/Decode deployment follows the Prefill "
"execution mode. HCCL therefore uses AICPU by default; leave "
"`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` unset."
msgstr ""
"在Atlas 800 "
"A3上，混合Prefill/Decode部署遵循Prefill执行模式。因此HCCL默认使用AICPU；请勿设置`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`。"

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 3 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"    - Assign `--data-parallel-start-rank` values `1`, `2`, and `3` to Nodes 1, 2, and 3 respectively."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、本地IP地址、网络接口、服务端口和DP RPC端口替换为目标环境中的实际值。\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME`必须是拥有`LOCAL_IP`的接口。\n"
"    - 先启动节点0。节点1至3上配置的`NODE0_IP`必须等于节点0上的`LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"    - 分别为节点1、2、3分配`--data-parallel-start-rank`值`1`、`2`、`3`。"

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-3\""
msgstr "=== \"节点1-3\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to `1`, `2`, or `3`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将`LOCAL_IP`和`NIC_NAME`设置为当前节点，并将`DP_START_RANK`设置为`1`、`2`或`3`。"

msgid ""
"| Setting                       | Node 0         | Nodes 1-3         | "
"Description                                            |"
msgstr ""
"| 设置                        | 节点0          | 节点1-3           | 描述"
"                                                   |"

msgid ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | Node 0 IP      | Current worker IP | "
"Each node uses its own IP address.                     |"
msgstr ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP`                    | 节点0 IP       | 当前工作节点IP    | "
"每个节点使用自己的IP地址。                             |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | Not required   | Node 0 IP         | "
"Workers use this address to join the DP group.         |"
msgstr ""
"    | `NODE0_IP`                    | 不需要         | 节点0 IP          | "
"工作节点使用此地址加入DP组。                           |"

msgid ""
"    | `--headless`                  | Omitted        | Enabled           | "
