msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | `0` by default | `1`, `2`, or `3`  | "
"Every node must own a unique DP rank.                  |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank`  | 默认为`0`      | `1`、`2`或`3`     | "
"每个节点必须拥有唯一的DP rank。                        |"

