msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A2 (eight-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A2（八节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated Atlas 800 A2 deployment uses eight nodes with eight NPUs per "
"node. Each node runs one DP rank and uses all eight local NPUs for tensor "
"parallelism. Every DP rank handles both Prefill and Decode, resulting in a "
"DP8/TP8/EP64 topology. Node 0 runs the API server and DP rank 0, while Nodes"
" 1 through 7 run headless DP workers. This baseline serves the language "
"model only."
msgstr ""
"经过验证的Atlas 800 A2部署使用八个节点，每个节点有八个NPU。每个节点运行一个DP rank，并使用全部八个本地NPU进行张量并行。每个DP"
" rank同时处理Prefill和Decode，最终拓扑为DP8/TP8/EP64。节点0运行API服务器和DP rank "
"0，而节点1至7运行无头DP工作节点。此基线仅提供语言模型服务。"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务前："

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 7 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
"    - Assign a unique `DP_START_RANK` from `1` through `7` to each worker node.\n"
"    - Ensure proxy bypass settings include all API and communication IP addresses used by the eight nodes."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、本地IP地址、网络接口、服务端口和DP RPC端口替换为目标环境中的实际值。\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的网络接口。\n"
"    - 先启动节点0。节点1至7上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点0上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"    - 为每个工作节点分配从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一 `DP_START_RANK`。\n"
"    - 确保代理绕过设置包含八个节点使用的所有API和通信IP地址。"

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点0\""

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-7\""
msgstr "=== \"节点1-7\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker node. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the "
"current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to a unique value from `1` through `7`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点，并将 `DP_START_RANK` 设置为从 `1` "
"到 `7` 的唯一值。"

msgid "The following values differ between the master and worker nodes:"
msgstr "主节点和工作节点之间的以下值有所不同："

msgid ""
"| Setting                      | Node 0       | Nodes 1-7"
"                         | Description                                      "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| 设置项                      | 节点0       | 节点1-7                         | 描述"
