msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer to"
" the [Public FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)."
msgstr ""
"有关常见的环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。"

msgid ""
"- **Q: Which multimodal inputs are supported by the current Kimi K3 implementation?**\n"
"A: The current local processor accepts image inputs. Video inputs are not supported.\n"
"- **Q: Which server options are required for Kimi K3 reasoning and tool calling?**\n"
"A: Configure `--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, `--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`, and `--tool-call-parser kimi_k3` together.\n"
"- **Q: How should TP size be selected?**\n"
"A: TP size must divide the checkpoint's attention-head count. It also affects KDA state layout and expert placement, so validate memory capacity and communication performance together.\n"
"- **Q: How is DSpark enabled in PD separation?**\n"
"A: Download `Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark`, set `DRAFT_MODEL_PATH` on both Prefill and Decode nodes, and pass the same `--speculative-config` to both. Prefill must retain `--enforce-eager`."
msgstr ""
"- **问：当前Kimi K3实现支持哪些多模态输入？**\n"
"答：当前的本地处理器接受图像输入。不支持视频输入。\n"
"- **问：Kimi K3推理和工具调用需要哪些服务器选项？**\n"
"答：需要同时配置`--tokenizer-mode kimi_k3`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice`、`--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`和`--tool-call-parser kimi_k3`。\n"
"- **问：如何选择TP大小？**\n"
"答：TP大小必须能整除检查点的注意力头数。它还会影响KDA状态布局和专家放置，因此需要同时验证内存容量和通信性能。\n"
"- **问：如何在PD分离中启用DSpark？**\n"
"答：下载`Inferact/Kimi-K3-DSpark`，在Prefill和Decode节点上均设置`DRAFT_MODEL_PATH`，并向两者传递相同的`--speculative-config`。Prefill必须保留`--enforce-eager`。"

